Package: libopenocean-messages1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: common messages for marine robotic systems (C++ library)
 openocean-messages defines common messages for ocean systems in Protobuf,
 and generates native types from them for several middleware and languages.
 .
 This package contains the shared library of the C++ Protobuf messages.

Package: libopenocean-messages-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libopenocean-messages1 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libprotobuf-dev,
         protobuf-compiler,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3
Description: common messages for marine robotic systems (development files)
 openocean-messages defines common messages for ocean systems in Protobuf,
 and generates native types from them for several middleware and languages.
 .
 This package contains the C++ headers, the .proto files, the CMake package
 (find_package(openocean_messages)), and the ROS 2 and LCM generators.

Package: python3-openocean-messages
Section: python
Architecture: all
Depends: python3-protobuf, ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: common messages for marine robotic systems (Python modules)
 openocean-messages defines common messages for ocean systems in Protobuf,
 and generates native types from them for several middleware and languages.
 .
 This package contains the Python Protobuf modules (openocean.messages).

Package: libopenocean-messages-nanopb1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: common messages for marine robotic systems (nanopb C library)
 openocean-messages defines common messages for ocean systems in Protobuf,
 and generates native types from them for several middleware and languages.
 .
 This package contains the shared library of the messages for nanopb, a
 Protobuf implementation in C for embedded systems.

Package: libopenocean-messages-nanopb-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libopenocean-messages-nanopb1 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libopenocean-messages-dev (= ${binary:Version}),
         libnanopb-dev,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: common messages for marine robotic systems (nanopb development files)
 openocean-messages defines common messages for ocean systems in Protobuf,
 and generates native types from them for several middleware and languages.
 .
 This package contains the nanopb C headers, and the nanopb component of the
 CMake package (find_package(openocean_messages COMPONENTS nanopb)).

Package: libopenocean-messages-lcm-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libopenocean-messages-dev (= ${binary:Version}),
         liblcm-dev,
         liblcm-bin,
         python3,
         python3-protobuf,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: common messages for marine robotic systems (LCM types)
 openocean-messages defines common messages for ocean systems in Protobuf,
 and generates native types from them for several middleware and languages.
 .
 This package contains the messages as LCM types (C++ headers and .lcm
 files), C++ converters between them and the Protobuf messages, and the lcm
 component of the CMake package (find_package(openocean_messages COMPONENTS lcm)).
